// endpoint_open_feed_image.proto — OpenFeedImage: open one image large over
// the workspace's feed. FEED section.
//
// A click on an image opens it: in Emacs, a thumbnail in the input window; in
// the webapp, an image the feed drew (a prompt bubble's, a held card's, a tool
